            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's new in 5.6</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Added Adobe Illustrator (.ai) support - batch export to JPEG or PNG with dedicated quality, DPI, color mode, and transparent-background settings</li>
                    <li>Fixed a layout bug where the RGB/CMYK toggle overlapped the DPI field in the InDesign JPEG/PNG export settings</li>
